name: sim.getProperties
description: Convenience function to fetches all properties of a specific target item
luaSynopsis: dict properties = sim.getProperties(int target, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: map properties = sim.getProperties(int target, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. options: an optional map. Set options.skipLarge = true to skip large data
outputs:
1. properties: properties
replacedBy:
- name: getProperties, class: object, file: object_getProperties.method
